+| `ex-straight-line-homotopy-between-maps-into-rn` | removed dead redundant MIT URL; retained UCR source | `911ef329af175a596d01b9703eafba59b00d2e61abfd519e879768e5e9a54938` | pending: `certifier-source-ex-straight-line-homotopy-between-maps-into-rn.result.json` transport failed before inference |
