+- The final impact receipt passes at **126 changed interfaces / 912 consumers**, all dispositioned `still-licensed`. The eight A6 URL changes affect ids already in the handed A4 changed-interface set and alter neither dependency nor citation-consumer graph, so the current 126/912 scope is unchanged. Material interfaces retain the exact five item-specific rationales; the 121-item pure class remains provenance/source/verification-only.
